      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The slope of the perpendicular bisector <math><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />The mid-point of the line segment&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi></mi></math> Equation of the bisector is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the required product&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>"
  }
